# A decision and the merge that brings its paths back together.
diagram activity
id login
title Either way of signing in ends at the same dashboard
narration A returning visitor signs in with a password or with a one-time code, depending on what they set up. Either way they land on the dashboard.

start begin
action open "open sign-in page"
decision how "has a password?"
action password "enter password"
action code "enter one-time code"
merge together
action dashboard "show dashboard"
end done

begin -> open
open -> how
how -> password : [yes]
how -> code : [no]
password -> together
code -> together
together -> dashboard
dashboard -> done
